  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 721.04 Exemption Request",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 721.04 Exemption Request.\n\n(a) The owner of a public water system who wishes to request an exemption for the system shall submit a request for exemption in writing to the department.\n\n(b) Owners of water systems who seek similar exemptions under similar circumstances may submit a joint request for exemptions.\n\nSource. #10617, eff 6-1-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
